  1. Complete or explicitly revise the liveness policy before public publication; it is currently required by policy but disabled in code (docs/VERIFICATION_POLICY.md:70).
  2. Correct the documented live Supabase email configuration blocker (docs/OPEN_ITEMS.md:16).
  3. Test Apple sign-in, push, notification actions, account switching, and media deletion on a real iOS development build.
  4. Add device-level E2E coverage for small, regular, and Pro Max iPhones.
  5. Test VoiceOver, Dynamic Type, Reduce Motion, offline recovery, slow connections, and UTC rollover.
  6. Re-run live draw/security verification and full-cycle simulation after the new migrations.
